1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:05,940
Sakisaki was facing me seriously.

2
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:08,530
But...

3
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:14,950
It's exactly because we're friends,
I just can't tell her that I love Mukai.

4
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:22,750
As long as I give up on Mukai,
everything will be fine.

5
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,730
Well, you won't give up anyway.

6
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:42,770
What?

7
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:46,530
I mean, after saying that you'll give up,

8
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:50,240
in the end, you're just gonna
change your mind again.

9
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:53,820
"Since Sakisaki letting him
two-timing her,

10
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:56,950
maybe she'll let me join too
just like Minase!"

11
00:00:58,370 --> 00:01:01,920
"I should just ask her to
let him three-timing!"

12
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:04,000
Won't that be funny?

13
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,500
Stop joking with me!

14
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:07,300
You're too serious after all.

15
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:11,050
And you're a coward,
I'm certain you'll be like that.

16
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:12,470
Oh!

17
00:01:12,470 --> 00:01:16,640
Maybe you just weren't
that serious about Naoya?

18
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:17,930
That's not true!

19
00:01:18,270 --> 00:01:23,100
Ever since I met Mukai
in middle school,

20
00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:25,900
I've always been in love with him.

21
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:30,530
But I held back my feelings
because of Sakisaki.

22
00:01:30,530 --> 00:01:33,360
I was happy enough
just being close to him.

23
00:01:33,820 --> 00:01:37,450
I saved a photo where he's caught
in the background by accident.

24
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:43,290
And I've been wearing this ribbon
that he gave me for years now.

25
00:01:43,290 --> 00:01:46,750
That was from him?
Not fair!

26
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:50,710
I even picked my current high school
so that I could be close to him!

27
00:01:50,710 --> 00:01:52,930
That's pretty serious.

28
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:59,350
Since your feelings are that serious,
how can you give up on him?

29
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:02,270
I can.

30
00:02:02,270 --> 00:02:04,230
I'll delete Mukai's photo!

31
00:02:04,230 --> 00:02:06,440
Send it to me before you do that!

32
00:02:14,820 --> 00:02:16,070
This ribbon, too!

33
00:02:20,490 --> 00:02:22,000
Even this ribbon...

34
00:02:39,810 --> 00:02:43,180
Can't be helped.

35
00:02:44,810 --> 00:02:49,980
You did help me to be alone with Naoya,
so I'll repay the favor.

36
00:02:50,820 --> 00:02:52,360
Hoshizaki?

37
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:58,740
Love sure is difficult.

38
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:03,580
I have no reason to help you.

39
00:03:03,580 --> 00:03:06,830
But I'll just do whatever I can.

40
00:03:06,830 --> 00:03:09,790
Even if I don't know the result
ahead of this, though.

41
00:03:10,170 --> 00:03:14,760
I think to have someone who fights
alongside me is not too bad.

42
00:03:19,090 --> 00:03:20,970
Do your best.

43
00:03:21,970 --> 00:03:23,600
Hoshizaki...

44
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:27,690
Well, you're just gonna
get rejected, anyway.

45
00:03:27,690 --> 00:03:30,650
At least, it'd be more direct than me!

46
00:03:30,650 --> 00:03:32,730
But Hoshizaki, I am...

47
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,320
Shino!

48
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:41,490
Oh, I messaged Naoya, by the way.

49
00:03:44,450 --> 00:03:46,660
My favorability is going to rise!

50
00:03:46,660 --> 00:03:49,040
I'm really a good girl!

51
00:03:51,210 --> 00:03:52,800
I was looking for you.

52
00:03:55,550 --> 00:03:57,090
Mukai...

53
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:02,930
Talk to us!

54
00:04:02,930 --> 00:04:04,140
Let go of me!

55
00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:08,770
I think I could guess about the feelings
you're trying to hide.

56
00:04:10,230 --> 00:04:12,440
But I haven't told Saki.

57
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:17,490
I don't want to tell her your hidden
feelings based on my guess.

58
00:04:17,490 --> 00:04:19,070
I don't want to say it!

59
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:25,450
I got cocky, carried away
and made a huge mistake!

60
00:04:28,370 --> 00:04:32,920
I never should have done that!

61
00:04:33,790 --> 00:04:35,380
Shino?

62
00:04:38,260 --> 00:04:44,850
I know that you're holding back
alone for Saki's sake.

63
00:04:47,470 --> 00:04:48,600
But you just have to tell her!

64
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,560
- Huh?
- Zero ingenuity?!

65
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:55,190
Think of how Saki will feel if you just
leave without explaining anything.

66
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:57,070
That's what I should be saying!

67
00:04:57,070 --> 00:05:00,150
If I tell her,
it'll only end up hurting her.

68
00:05:01,110 --> 00:05:02,820
Do you even get that?

69
00:05:02,820 --> 00:05:03,780
I do!

70
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:08,500
I know that I don't have the right to
ask you to reveal your feelings.

71
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:10,960
Since it'll cause problems.

72
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:12,920
But I don't want things to stay like this.

73
00:05:13,290 --> 00:05:15,857
If I were someone who
only did something right,

74
00:05:15,859 --> 00:05:18,130
then I wouldn't have
asked for two-timing!

75
00:05:18,130 --> 00:05:20,090
That's right!

76
00:05:21,220 --> 00:05:23,550
Why are you doing this?

77
00:05:23,550 --> 00:05:26,810
Shino, when you were fighting with Saki,

78
00:05:26,810 --> 00:05:30,520
you must've realized how much
she thinks of you, right?

79
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:34,360
We're friends, aren't we?

80
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:37,536
I don't want to see two friends
who care a lot about each other

81
00:05:37,538 --> 00:05:39,690
breaking apart like this.

82
00:05:39,690 --> 00:05:41,770
If you care about each other that much,

83
00:05:41,770 --> 00:05:45,570
I don't believe telling the truth
would ruin everything!

84
00:05:45,570 --> 00:05:46,870
But...

85
00:05:48,910 --> 00:05:51,500
No matter what happens,

86
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:53,960
I'll definitely help you.

87
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:59,000
So please tell us, about what you've
always been hiding from her,

88
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:02,420
and what you were about
to say last night to me.

89
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:06,890
It won't end until you say it.
I won't let this end!

90
00:06:06,890 --> 00:06:10,140
To me, Saki...

91
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:16,110
And even to yourself.

92
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:21,400
Tell me why you're still
keeping that ribbon!

93
00:06:39,210 --> 00:06:42,090
Tell us, Shino.

94
00:06:44,380 --> 00:06:49,140
I didn't want to cause trouble
for Sakisaki and you.

95
00:06:51,060 --> 00:06:57,440
I've been hiding this feeling
all these years.

96
00:06:58,900 --> 00:07:00,480
Shino...

97
00:07:01,150 --> 00:07:07,450
I knew that I'd never give up.

98
00:07:08,030 --> 00:07:11,410
I thought it couldn't be helped.

99
00:07:11,950 --> 00:07:14,540
I couldn't even hide that,

100
00:07:14,540 --> 00:07:16,870
made you worry,

101
00:07:16,870 --> 00:07:19,250
and it became like this.

102
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:23,920
Sakisaki, I am...

103
00:07:25,340 --> 00:07:29,340
The truth is...

104
00:07:35,770 --> 00:07:40,810
I am a woman who let my boyfriend
two-timed me with a punch!

105
00:07:41,190 --> 00:07:43,770
No matter what feeling
you're hiding from me,

106
00:07:43,770 --> 00:07:46,030
at worst, I'll just have to
punch you too.

107
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:48,530
So it will be fine!

108
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,950
Sakisaki.

109
00:07:55,370 --> 00:07:56,680
I've been...

110
00:07:58,540 --> 00:08:00,750
in love with Mukai.

111
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:04,090
For a long time now.

112
00:08:09,430 --> 00:08:09,890
Sorry!

113
00:08:09,890 --> 00:08:10,550
Huh?

114
00:08:10,550 --> 00:08:13,010
What?!

115
00:08:13,010 --> 00:08:16,480
Huh? Wha— Wait a second!

116
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:18,520
Shino, you love Naoya?

117
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:19,980
Did Naoya just reject you?

118
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:23,690
How could you reject
my precious friend like that?

119
00:08:23,690 --> 00:08:25,690
Saki, you're confused!

120
00:08:25,692 --> 00:08:29,402
Did you not notice it from
the way things were going?

121
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:33,120
How do I say this...

122
00:08:33,870 --> 00:08:36,750
I thought she was about to
confess to me.

123
00:08:39,040 --> 00:08:44,340
You know, she's always been
so nice to me.

124
00:08:44,340 --> 00:08:47,300
Of course not, you idiot.

125
00:08:50,090 --> 00:08:51,930
Well, I guess so.

126
00:08:53,890 --> 00:08:55,720
I see.

127
00:08:57,220 --> 00:09:00,730
You also love Naoya.

128
00:09:02,190 --> 00:09:07,400
And for a long time?

129
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:12,280
I'm sorry that I've never noticed!

130
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:15,030
Sakisaki?

131
00:09:16,540 --> 00:09:17,620
Saki.

132
00:09:18,250 --> 00:09:20,210
Saki.

133
00:09:23,210 --> 00:09:26,170
Me too...

134
00:09:26,170 --> 00:09:31,130
I'm so sorry I've never told you!

135
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:36,010
I forgive you!

136
00:09:36,010 --> 00:09:40,020
(Her Decision, And Then)

137
00:09:40,350 --> 00:09:44,100
She was rejected 100 times faster
than I imagined.

138
00:10:02,710 --> 00:10:06,670
Good morning, Shino.

139
00:10:06,670 --> 00:10:09,550
Good morning, Sakisaki.

140
00:10:09,550 --> 00:10:11,550
Sorry about everything yesterday.

141
00:10:11,550 --> 00:10:14,050
Don't worry about that.

142
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:20,810
Me, too, how do I say this?

143
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:24,770
Really, how do I say this...

144
00:10:24,770 --> 00:10:26,730
You don't have to
be considerate to me at all.

145
00:10:26,730 --> 00:10:29,520
You got rejected so thoroughly.
So funny!

146
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:31,070
Yeah, thank you for that.

147
00:10:31,070 --> 00:10:32,990
Mirika!

148
00:10:32,990 --> 00:10:35,240
She just got rejected,
what's the big deal?

149
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:37,030
Can you be more kind to her?

150
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:40,740
It's fine. She's not wrong anyway.

151
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:43,660
A few years of unrequited love
went bust in a flash.

152
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:45,370
So awkward.

153
00:10:45,370 --> 00:10:47,130
So funny!

154
00:10:48,420 --> 00:10:50,800
I will return home first.

155
00:10:53,380 --> 00:10:54,470
Right, Naoya!

156
00:10:54,470 --> 00:10:55,260
Yes?

157
00:10:55,260 --> 00:10:57,720
Cheer Shino somehow!

158
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,600
Okay!

159
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,720
Just like that?

160
00:11:03,770 --> 00:11:07,650
I also wanted to talk to you,
so this is good.

161
00:11:09,770 --> 00:11:11,980
Summer will be over soon.

162
00:11:12,940 --> 00:11:14,610
Right.

163
00:11:14,612 --> 00:11:19,072
I never thought
I'd experience a summer like this.

164
00:11:19,950 --> 00:11:21,540
Shino...

165
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:24,200
I'm really sorry!

166
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:29,250
I forced you to tell us your feelings,
then I rejected you in an instant.

167
00:11:29,250 --> 00:11:31,670
I'm sure I must have hurt you a lot.

168
00:11:31,670 --> 00:11:35,630
I'm going to do my best so things don't
get awkward between you and Saki!

169
00:11:37,510 --> 00:11:38,890
Mukai.

170
00:11:45,140 --> 00:11:47,020
I love you.

171
00:11:55,490 --> 00:11:58,280
I love how you're always
giving it your all.

172
00:11:59,030 --> 00:12:01,700
I love how you never give up.

173
00:12:02,410 --> 00:12:06,370
I love how you're looking
straight at me.

174
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:09,750
I love how you're in love with Sakisaki.

175
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:12,090
I love your eyes.

176
00:12:12,090 --> 00:12:16,050
I hate that you're two-timing her, though.

177
00:12:16,970 --> 00:12:21,640
But I wanted to be with you,
no matter what.

178
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:23,680
Shino...

179
00:12:26,890 --> 00:12:30,310
I wanted us to be alone
so I could tell you that.

180
00:12:31,310 --> 00:12:35,780
I'm sorry I couldn't respond to
your feelings.

181
00:12:36,690 --> 00:12:40,660
Can I ask you why?

182
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:45,830
It's because I want to make
Saki and Minase happy.

183
00:12:47,750 --> 00:12:49,500
I thought as much.

184
00:12:49,500 --> 00:12:51,000
Forgive me.

185
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:53,040
No, thank you.

186
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:56,000
Honestly, it's refreshing.

187
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:58,130
However...

188
00:12:59,470 --> 00:13:05,930
When you succeed in making them happy,
and if you can still afford it...

189
00:13:08,310 --> 00:13:11,730
Then I would have a chance, wouldn't I?

190
00:13:16,820 --> 00:13:19,440
I guess so?

191
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,780
Hey, Naoya!

192
00:13:20,780 --> 00:13:22,740
Shino, wait!

193
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:26,450
Sorry, even after he rejected me
thoroughly yesterday...

194
00:13:26,450 --> 00:13:29,410
I might be an idiot too.

195
00:13:30,710 --> 00:13:38,430
I realized that holding back my feelings
wouldn't be used to anyone at all.

196
00:13:39,350 --> 00:13:40,380
That's why!

197
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:46,300
I also want to become Mukai's girlfriend!

198
00:13:53,230 --> 00:13:54,810
What do you think, Sakisaki?

199
00:13:54,810 --> 00:13:55,360
Huh?

200
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:58,440
If you're definitely against it,
then I'll try to give up.

201
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,570
Hold on a sec!

202
00:13:59,570 --> 00:14:01,240
But if you're not...

203
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:03,070
This is so sudden.

204
00:14:03,070 --> 00:14:05,780
How do I say this?

205
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:09,740
Then, give it some thought.

206
00:14:10,870 --> 00:14:13,540
Until then, I won't give up.

207
00:14:16,590 --> 00:14:19,170
Bye, I'm going home first!

208
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:29,970
Seriously?!

209
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:33,270
I said it.

210
00:14:36,730 --> 00:14:40,190
- It's falling! Naoya, save me!
- We'll be arriving at Haneda shortly.

211
00:14:52,540 --> 00:14:53,540
What should we do?

212
00:14:53,540 --> 00:14:54,040
Huh?!

213
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:54,750
Took you long enough!

214
00:14:54,750 --> 00:14:57,190
I mean, not only did Shino love Naoya,

215
00:14:57,190 --> 00:15:00,840
but she won't give up and yet even
asked him for three-timing!

216
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,710
That's fair.

217
00:15:02,710 --> 00:15:06,590
Don't you think it's weird that
Shino would be okay for three-timing?

218
00:15:08,050 --> 00:15:09,550
Well...

219
00:15:09,550 --> 00:15:10,180
Ah...

220
00:15:10,180 --> 00:15:11,640
(The girl who is okay with two-timing)

221
00:15:11,640 --> 00:15:14,600
I'm asking the wrong person!

222
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,190
Calm down, Saki!

223
00:15:16,190 --> 00:15:18,060
But you know...

224
00:15:19,020 --> 00:15:21,020
What are you doing in front of the door?

225
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:22,150
So noisy.

226
00:15:22,150 --> 00:15:23,360
Shino!

227
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:25,320
Shino.

228
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,740
Mukai.

229
00:15:27,700 --> 00:15:30,610
I made some sweets while I was waiting.

230
00:15:30,610 --> 00:15:32,160
Want some?

231
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,240
Huh?

232
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:35,500
Sure.

233
00:15:35,500 --> 00:15:36,460
Really?

234
00:15:38,250 --> 00:15:39,630
That makes me happy.

235
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:41,960
So cute!

236
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:44,050
Hold on! Shino!

237
00:15:44,050 --> 00:15:48,390
I'm not going to get in your way,
rather, I'm going to cheer you.

238
00:15:49,930 --> 00:15:51,640
Right, Mukai?

239
00:15:53,430 --> 00:15:55,680
I'm going to help you study
from now on.

240
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:56,350
Huh?

241
00:15:56,350 --> 00:16:00,190
If you want to continue the two-timing,
you have to study.

242
00:16:00,190 --> 00:16:02,070
You're right.

243
00:16:02,070 --> 00:16:05,030
And, I'm the current top student!

244
00:16:05,030 --> 00:16:06,570
That'd be a huge help!

245
00:16:06,570 --> 00:16:07,490
Naoya?!

246
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:11,200
I can help you anytime you want.

247
00:16:12,780 --> 00:16:17,410
I'll teach you thoroughly all night long.

248
00:16:17,410 --> 00:16:19,870
That's so lewd!

249
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:21,790
I didn't mean it that way!

250
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:25,300
Yeah, you're lewd!

251
00:16:26,550 --> 00:16:28,470
What are you saying?

252
00:16:29,260 --> 00:16:30,930
But...

253
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:37,350
If Mukai really wants to, then...

254
00:16:37,350 --> 00:16:39,890
The embodiment of lewd!

255
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:42,860
Naoya, what are you going to do?

256
00:16:42,860 --> 00:16:44,730
Well...

257
00:16:44,730 --> 00:16:47,570
I'm going to cheer you three.

258
00:16:47,570 --> 00:16:50,360
I won't steal him like Hoshizaki.

259
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:56,830
Mukai, you can think about me after
you make the two of them happy.

260
00:16:56,830 --> 00:16:59,250
I can't find any reason to refuse her.

261
00:16:59,250 --> 00:17:00,790
Understandable.

262
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:04,000
But, Shino, are you really serious?

263
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:05,710
I am!

264
00:17:06,050 --> 00:17:08,260
I know that this sounds stupid.

265
00:17:08,260 --> 00:17:11,630
There would be an issue
with society and morals.

266
00:17:12,180 --> 00:17:15,100
I went that far in trying to make
him stop two-timing.

267
00:17:16,010 --> 00:17:18,100
But I still love him!

268
00:17:20,310 --> 00:17:26,070
